.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# --- Notes ---
# lib/*.jar is deliberately NOT ignored. CustomNPCs and Ars Nouveau are not on any
# Maven repository, and build.gradle resolves them from lib/ via a flatDir repository,
# so a clone without them cannot compile. See lib/README.md.
